    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_01",
      "hash64": "A44AC6E088F76317",
      "text": "Oooh ho ho ho !\\nOooh ho ho ho ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A44AC7E088F764CA",
      "text": "Vois-tu cela, Milio ?\\nMais quelle jolie flaque d’eau-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_01",
      "hash64": "440A68EDEC31BD61",
      "text": "Il s’agit en fait d’un lac, ma chère Naire !\\nEt le plus grand de tout Paldea, qui plus est.\\r\\nC’est bien le fameux Lac Asrol ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A44AC8E088F7667D",
      "text": "Un... un lac, dis-tu ?! Un étang, à la rigueur.\\nMais... un lac-han ?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A44AC1E088F75A98",
      "text": "Cela dit, Milio... la différence entre un lac et un\\nétang doit être une question de point de vue-han.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_02",
      "hash64": "440A65EDEC31B848",
      "text": "C’est bien possible, ma chère Naire...\\c\\nAprès tout, nous voyons le monde à travers\\ndes yeux d’influenceurs. Qui sait ce que\\r\\nles autres appellent un étang ou un lac ?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A44AC2E088F75C4B",
      "text": "Hmmm... Oh, mais qui voilà... ?\\nNotre fameux col bleu-han ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_03",
      "hash64": "440A66EDEC31B9FB",
      "text": "Pas d’erreur possible : c’est encore et\\ntoujours [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0403)]luielle ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0403"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A44AC3E088F75DFE",
      "text": "Tu tombes bien. Qu’est-ce qui fait, selon toi,\\nla différence entre un lac et un étang ?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_select_01",
      "hash64": "C8C1F5BDFADE575F",
      "text": "La taille ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_select_02",
      "hash64": "C8C1F6BDFADE5912",
      "text": "La profondeur ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_07",
      "hash64": "A44AC4E088F75FB1",
      "text": "Tout simplement... Je n’en attendais pas moins\\nde toi, m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0102)]ona ch[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]erère ! Tu es empli[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e d’une sagesse\\r\\npopulaire qui nous dépasse ![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0102"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
