          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_08",
      "hash64": "A44ABDE088F753CC",
      "text": "Si je reçois quelque chose, j’ai pour principe,\\nen tant qu’influenceuse, d’offrir en retour...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_09",
      "hash64": "A44ABEE088F7557F",
      "text": "Alors, accepte ceci.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_10",
      "hash64": "A44E4BE088FA7AED",
      "text": "Écoute attentivement...\\nLe bonheur, c’est comme une étendue d’eau...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_11",
      "hash64": "A44E4AE088FA793A",
      "text": "Selon ton état d’esprit, il peut t’apparaître\\ncomme une flaque, un étang ou un lac-han.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_man_04",
      "hash64": "440A6BEDEC31C27A",
      "text": "Tu m’impressionneras toujours, Naire !\\c\\nCette capacité à absorber ce que l’on vient\\nde t’enseigner et à le retransmettre aussitôt\\r\\nde manière magnifiée est renversante ![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_007_woman_12",
      "hash64": "A44E49E088FA7787",
      "text": "Trêve de bavardages-han !\\c\\nJe veux me promener sur une [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]montagne aussi[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]immaculée[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] que la réputation de mon entreprise.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
